Detect Aberration	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Divination	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:60 ft.	TARGETAREA:Cone-shaped emanation	DURATION:Concentration, up to (CASTERLEVEL) minutes [D]	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Druid=1[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Gatekeeper Initiate]	DESC:You can detect the presence of aberrations by observing the disruption of the natural order around them. The amount of information revealed depends on how long you study a particular area. 1st Round: Presence or absence of aberrations. 2nd Round: Number of aberrations in the area and the strength of the strongest aberration's aura. If the strongest aberration aura's strength is overwhelming (see below) and the creature h as HD of at least twice your character level, you are stunned for 1 round and the spell ends. 3rd Round: The strength and location of each aberration's aura. If an aura is outside your line of sight, then you discern its direction but not its exact location. Aura Strength: The strength of an aberration's aura is determined by the HD of the aberration, as given on the following table: Unlike similar spells, detect aberration does not reveal lingering auras. Each round, you can turn to detect aberrations in a new area. The spell can penetrate barriers, but 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt blocks it.	SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Detoxify	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:30 ft.	TARGETAREA:Creatures and objects in 30-ft.-radius spread	DURATION:Instantaneous and (CASTERLEVEL*10) minutes; see text	SAVEINFO:Will negates (object)	SPELLRES:Yes (object)	SOURCEPAGE:p.110
