Maddening Scream	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Enchantment	SUBSCHOOL:Compulsion	DESCRIPTOR:Mind-Affecting	COMPS:V	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Living creature touched	DURATION:1d4+1 rounds	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Sorcerer,Wizard=8	DOMAINS:Madness=8	DESC:The subject cannot keep from screaming, gibbering, and leaping about as though completely mad. This spell makes it impossible for the subject to do anything other than race about caterwauling. The Armor Class of the creature takes a -4 penalty, it succeeds on Reflex saving throws only on a roll of 20, and it does not benefit from any shield it may be bearing.	SOURCEPAGE:p.113
