Repair Critical Damage	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Transmutation	CLASSES:Artificer,Sorcerer,Wizard=4	DESC:As repair light damage, except repair critical damage repairs 4d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +20).	SOURCEPAGE:p.114
Repair Light Damage	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Construct touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Artificer,Sorcerer,Wizard=1	DESC:When laying your hands upon a construct that has at least 1 hit point remaining, or a living construct with -9 or more hit points, you transmute its structure to repair damage it has taken. The spell repairs 1d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +5).	SOURCEPAGE:p.114
Repair Moderate Damage	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Transmutation	CLASSES:Artificer,Sorcerer,Wizard=2	DESC:As repair light damage, except repair moderate damage repairs 2d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +10).	SOURCEPAGE:p.114
Repair Serious Damage	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Transmutation	CLASSES:Artificer,Sorcerer,Wizard=3	DESC:As repair light damage, except repair serious damage repairs 3d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +15).	SOURCEPAGE:p.114
