Status, Greater	KEY:Status (Greater)	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Divination	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One touched creature/3 levels	TARGETAREA:Creature touched .	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) hours	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SAVEINFO:Yes (harmless) For example, if you become aware (through the greater status spell) that one of your linked companions is dying, you can cast cure moderate wounds to try to revive her.	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	SOURCEPAGE:p.116
