Skill Appraise Enhancement.MOD	DESC:An item imbued with this infusion grants a +2 circumstance bonus on a specific skill check (determined by the caster) to a character who wears or wields it. This bonus increases by 1 for every two caster levels (to +3 at 2nd level, +4 at 4th level, +5 at 6th level, and so forth). Material Component: A length of fine, black thread.
Skill Balance Enhancement.MOD	DESC:An item imbued with this infusion grants a +2 circumstance bonus on a specific skill check (determined by the caster) to a character who wears or wields it. This bonus increases by 1 for every two caster levels (to +3 at 2nd level, +4 at 4th level, +5 at 6th level, and so forth). Material Component: A length of fine, black thread.
